{x_panel
    {message
        output={@
You examine the panel, it is held in place by four screws.
<?[room]((panel_removed)) = 'true'?>

It has been removed, you can enter it using: enter panel
<else>

Since you have a screwdriver, you can remove the panel with:
remove panel
</?>
        }
    }

    {logic
        logic={@
            ?[screwdriver]parent = [player]
        }
        output={@
You examine the weird panel. It is held in place by screws.
If you had a screwdriver you could remove the panel.
        }
    }
}

{remove_panel
    {message
        output={@
You remove the panel.
        }
    }
}
















{input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((x_panel))
    {act, logic=x_panel, tags=!_type|room }
}

{input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((remove_panel))
    {act, logic=remove_panel, tags=!_type|room }
    {set, logic=[room]((panel_removed)), output=true }
}

{input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((enter_panel))
    {move, logic=cult_temple, tags=[player]
        output={@
You step into the cramped passage that lay beyond the panel opening.
The passage soon becomes a narrow hall, then it opens up into a large room.

        }
    }

    {logic
        logic={@
            ?[room]((panel_removed)) = 'true'
        }

        output={@

Where are you trying to go?
        }
    }

    {logic
        logic={@
            ?[invite_chip]parent = [player]
        }
    }
}

{input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((enter_panel))
    {move, logic=backrooms_lobby, tags=[player]
        output={@
You step into the cramped passage that lay beyond the panel opening.
The passage soon becomes a narrow hall, then it opens up into a large room.

You find yourself in what appears to be a vast temple.
Chairs line the left and right walls of the temple, with
a path leading forward to an alter.
Just behind the altar, hovering in air, is a large, purple, neon circle lighting
up the entire space.

Bowing before the circle you see hooded figures.

A tall individual emerges from behind the altar. It is wearing a red hooded cloak
and a deer skull mask with glowing neon antlers.
It floats up to you and forcefully grabs your arm, dragging you into a narrow
door in the left wall. It shoves you into the room and closes the door as it
exits.

There is no handle handle on the door. It is impossible to open it.

        }
    }

    {logic
        logic={@
            ?[room]((panel_removed)) = 'true'
        }

        output={@

Where are you trying to go?
        }
    }

    {logic
        logic={@
            ?[invite_chip]parent != [player]
        }
    }
}
